<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>ecommerce-prompts</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #111; }
h1 { font-size: 18pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p>StartbusinessAI Prompt Pack: Dropshipping and Ecommerce<br><br>1. Product Research<br>Suggest product angles for [niche] and rank by urgency, margin, and ad potential.<br><br>2. Customer Persona<br>Create a buyer persona for [product].<br><br>3. Product Page<br>Write product page copy for [product] targeting [buyer].<br><br>4. Benefit Rewrite<br>Turn these features into customer benefits: [features].<br><br>5. Ad Angles<br>Create 20 ad angles for [product].<br><br>6. Video Script<br>Write a short video ad script for [product].<br><br>7. Email Sequence<br>Create a 5-email welcome or abandoned cart sequence for [product].<br><br>8. FAQ<br>Write product FAQs that reduce buyer hesitation.<br><br>9. Review Mining<br>Analyze these reviews and extract buyer language, pains, and benefits: [reviews].<br><br>10. Bundle Ideas<br>Suggest bundle offers for [product].<br><br>11. Store Audit<br>Audit this store page for conversion issues: [paste page].<br><br>12. Offer Test<br>Create 5 offer tests for [product], including hook, discount, and CTA.<br></p>
</body>
</html>
